      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how happily their dogs settle into boarding and daycare routines, frequently making friends in small, supervised playgroups organized by size and temperament. Clients report that shy, senior, or reactive dogs receive dedicated affection and return home relaxed and cheerful."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 28,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive canine hospitality team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients describe the facility team as warm, accommodating, and deeply dedicated to animal wellbeing. Reviewers appreciate that handlers spend one-on-one time cuddling pets, observe individual dietary and bedding preferences, and greet returning dogs with genuine enthusiasm."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 25,
      "title": {
        "en": "Frequent photo updates and messaging"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents overwhelmingly praise Yardstick Lakewood for sending numerous photo updates and descriptive status messages throughout each day. Owners traveling locally or overseas report that these regular reports provide reassurance and eliminate boarding anxiety by showing their dogs thriving."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Yardstick Dog Hotel provide regular updates during boarding?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients frequently highlight receiving daily photo updates and detailed progress messages throughout their pets' stays."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How are playgroups arranged for daycare and boarding dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The facility organizes supervised play sessions in small groups matched by dog size, temperament, and energy level."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can owners bring personal items like dog beds and toys?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers appreciate that the hotel allows owners to bring home bedding and toys to keep pets comfortable in their suites."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are dogs housed in crates or private rooms?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The hotel features individual sleeping suites rather than traditional crates, offering spacious and spotless accommodations."
      },
      "basis": "both"
